  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-jin043-wangcheng:pedigree" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-jin043-wangcheng:pedigree:m0000" ref="rlk_lzd_86c_B">微</persName>字<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-jin043-wangcheng:pedigree:m0002" ref="rlk_lzd_86c_B">幼仁</persName>，琅邪人。祖父<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-jin043-wangcheng:pedigree:m0011" ref="kwx_czc_d4c">乂</persName>，平北將軍。父<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-jin043-wangcheng:pedigree:m0019" ref="rlk_lzd_86c">澄</persName>，荊州刺史。<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-jin043-wangcheng:pedigree:m0026" ref="rlk_lzd_86c_B">微</persName>歴尚書郎、右軍司馬。</p>
